"203473":{"averageScore":51,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/203473-KCGlCZL2ApjB.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b203473-pzyaqV432Qko.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b203473-pzyaqV432Qko.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b203473-pzyaqV432Qko.jpg"},"description":"Urban legends come to life…Everyone’s heard an urban legend before, but few have ever come face-to-face with one. These phenomena are everywhere, existing in the shadows of reality. More and more of them have been appearing in the wake of the faceless kid sighted all over Japan. If you see her or one of the urban legends she brings―pray the boy in the red hood finds you before it’s too late. You won’t stand a chance on your own. But with his help, you may just live to see another day…\n<br><br>\n(Source: Yen Press)","duration":25,"episodes":12,"favourites":57,"format":"TV","genres":["Horror","Mystery","Supernatural"],"hashtag":"#恐怖コレクター","id":203473,"idMal":63053,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":52,"popularity":6604,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2026,"source":"OTHER","startDate":{"day":10,"month":10,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","studios":[{"id":6738,"name":"Studio Palette"}],"synonyms":["Horror Collector"],"tags":[{"id":233,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Youkai","rank":60},{"id":1719,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Exorcism","rank":60},{"id":1689,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Curses","rank":60},{"id":321,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":40},{"id":220,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Ghost","rank":10}],"title":{"english":"HORROR COLLECTOR","native":"恐怖コレクター","romaji":"Kyoufu Collector"},"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793336446},
"203490":{"averageScore":69,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#fef150","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx203490-YQXiymUiDQNA.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx203490-YQXiymUiDQNA.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx203490-YQXiymUiDQNA.jpg"},"description":"The manga centers on high school student Ito Hazui. During her spring break at the end of her first year of high school, Ito's mother remarries, and Ito moves to live with her new family, becoming Ito Narita. Upon arriving at her new house, Ito is shocked to learn she now has four younger step-brothers. Ito tries her hardest to get along with all of the new members of her family, but the eldest brother Gen is a bit cold to her. However, under his aloof facade, he occasionally shows his kindness.\n<BR><BR>\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":24,"episodes":24,"favourites":206,"format":"TV","genres":["Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"],"hashtag":"#うち弟アニメ #うちの弟どもがすみません","id":203490,"idMal":63061,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":70,"popularity":12863,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":4,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","studios":[{"id":6075,"name":"Lay-duce"}],"synonyms":["Sorry About My Little Brothers","UchiOto","うち弟"],"tags":[{"id":53,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Shoujo","rank":97},{"id":87,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Family Life","rank":82},{"id":1045,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Heterosexual","rank":80},{"id":98,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":76},{"id":1102,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Inseki","rank":75},{"id":123,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Male Harem","rank":48},{"id":46,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"School","rank":40},{"id":138,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Age Gap","rank":37},{"id":186,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Crossdressing","rank":26},{"id":595,"isMediaSpoi